      "fontFamily": 6,
      "text": "PostgreSQL 17  +  PostGIS 3.6  +  pgSTAC 1.0.0\n(Single instance — no replication at MVP)\n\n• STAC catalog (scenes + derived products)\n• App schemas (users, AOIs, farms, jobs)\n• Spatial queries / vector tile source",
