      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "text": "Operations  —  pgBackRest (DB backup, 30 d retention)   •   restic (filesystem backup, 30 d, encrypted)   •   SOPS + age (secrets at rest)\nTrivy (container image scan)   •   structlog → JSON → journald   •   /healthz + /readyz   •   systemd unit wraps Docker Compose",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
