      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "text": "Legend:   Blue = users / frontend     Cyan = edge (Nginx)     Green = app services     Red = workers + cache     Purple = data stores     Orange = ops / backups     Pink (dashed) = external systems / off-host\nDashed border = process boundary (VM, external).   Dashed arrow = network call leaving the VM.   All flows shown are over loopback / Docker network unless labeled otherwise.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "pJPUNTHY81DpT2xNrXEWc",
      "originalText": "Legend:   Blue = users / frontend     Cyan = edge (Nginx)     Green = app services     Red = workers + cache     Purple = data stores     Orange = ops / backups     Pink (dashed) = external systems / off-host\nDashed border = process boundary (VM, external).   Dashed arrow = network call leaving the VM.   All flows shown are over loopback / Docker network unless labeled otherwise.",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "index": "ax",
      "autoResize": true
    },
