      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "text": "SINGLE LINUX VM + DOCKER COMPOSE\nOne VM running every container under one Docker Compose project, wrapped in a systemd unit.\nProvides: smallest possible operational footprint — one host to patch, snapshot, and back up.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "y_-2kMN6oKsmIblbDLvj5",
      "originalText": "SINGLE LINUX VM + DOCKER COMPOSE\nOne VM running every container under one Docker Compose project, wrapped in a systemd unit.\nProvides: smallest possible operational footprint — one host to patch, snapshot, and back up.",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "index": "b01",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "HTZJKprqNBS7P6Bkq49cv",
      "type": "rectangle",
