      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "text": "FASTAPI (+ STAC SUB-APP) — APPLICATION BACKEND\nUser REST APIs (AOIs, farms, jobs) and the STAC scene-discovery API mounted at /stac.\nProvides: business logic + JWT-protected API surface in a single Python process.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sXMh9pp9kg-R68lP2xrSG",
      "originalText": "FASTAPI (+ STAC SUB-APP) — APPLICATION BACKEND\nUser REST APIs (AOIs, farms, jobs) and the STAC scene-discovery API mounted at /stac.\nProvides: business logic + JWT-protected API surface in a single Python process.",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "index": "b05",
      "autoResize": true
    },
