      "fontFamily": 6,
      "text": "CELERY WORKER + BEAT — BACKGROUND JOBS\nDownload NRSC scenes → transcode to COG → reproject EPSG:7755 → NDVI/NDWI/SAR → register STAC.\nProvides: heavy data processing off the request path so the UI stays responsive.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ww5ayz1tRThmL43sjNS3D",
      "originalText": "CELERY WORKER + BEAT — BACKGROUND JOBS\nDownload NRSC scenes → transcode to COG → reproject EPSG:7755 → NDVI/NDWI/SAR → register STAC.\nProvides: heavy data processing off the request path so the UI stays responsive.",
