      "text": "VALKEY — CACHE + QUEUE BROKER\nIn-memory store: Celery message broker + result backend, plus app cache and session store.\nProvides: low-latency cache reads and reliable job queueing.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
