    {
      "id": "st0JsYYlBkrwNwFZvK2J9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1523.8727079219464,
      "y": 3386.4776018599887,
      "width": 1609.578857421875,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1638262136,
      "version": 167,
      "versionNonce": 1383891307,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778894761522,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Build-order suggestion\n- Database + Valkey + Nginx skeleton (infra plumbing).\n- App API with JWT verify + /healthz / /readyz + Alembic baseline.\n- Celery worker + beat with one Bhoonidhi ingest job → COG transcode → STAC register (proves the data pipeline end-to-end).\n- STAC sub-app + TiTiler + Martin (proves the read path).\n- React SPA with MapLibre consuming TiTiler + Martin + STAC search.\n- Backup/restore scripts + SOPS + Trivy in CI before go-live.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Build-order suggestion\n- Database + Valkey + Nginx skeleton (infra plumbing).\n- App API with JWT verify + /healthz / /readyz + Alembic baseline.\n- Celery worker + beat with one Bhoonidhi ingest job → COG transcode → STAC register (proves the data pipeline end-to-end).\n- STAC sub-app + TiTiler + Martin (proves the read path).\n- React SPA with MapLibre consuming TiTiler + Martin + STAC search.\n- Backup/restore scripts + SOPS + Trivy in CI before go-live.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
